#Linux

 >> t := Moman nouvo.
 
t zòn: ['Europe/Amsterdam'].
t ane: 2020, mwa: 8, jou: 2, lè: 21, minit: 2, segonn: 1.

>> a := t lè.
>> ams := t zòn.

t zòn: ['US/Hawaii'].
>> b := t lè.
>> hw := t zòn.

Sòti
ekri: (
	['It's diff in zone2 than in zone1']
	zone1: ams,
	zone2: hw,
	diff: (
		(b > a)
		swa: ['later'] oswa: ['earlier']
	)
),
nouvo-liy.
 